  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CRAFT - Catalytic Capital for First Private Investment Fund for Adaptation Technologies in Developing Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CRAFT blends commercial and concessional capital into a private equity fund that offers strategic support to companies offering climate resilience products and services. The goal is to expand the availability of products and services for climate adaptation and resilience in order to reduce the vulnerability of individuals and businesses to climate impacts. 

&#x2022; CRAFT is the first dedicated commercial investment vehicle to focus on climate resilience and adaptation.
&#x2022; It focuses on scaling up adaptation investments in the target countries through GCF concessional financing.
&#x2022; The CRAFT investment approach of bringing technology transfer will help build technical skills in climate resilience and adaptation to developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
